  "type": "MCQ",
  "question": "Suppose \\(a,b,c\\) are real numbers such that \\(a^2b^2+b^2c^2+c^2a^2=k\\), where \\(k\\) is a constant. Then the set of all possible values of \\(abc(a+b+c)\\) is precisely the interval",
